  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRSA will rehanilitate a secondary school in Vushtri, Kosovo. The schools 1800 students are currently displaced in three primary schools in Vushtri. The school, witch has been lotted and in great need of repairs because to lack maintennace, should be rehabilitatted by january, 2000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRV insats &#xe4;r rehabilitering av ett gymnasium i Vushtri, Kosovo Skolan &#xe4;r en yrkesskola med teknik inriktining som utsatts f&#xf6;r plund- ring, men &#xe4;ven &#xe4;r eftersatt d&#xe5; underh&#xe5;llet ej skett. Idag finns 1800 elever som skall b&#xf6;rja i skolan Behovet &#xe4;r stort att skolan s&#xe4;ttsbrukbart skick, och arbetena ber&#xe4;knas vara klara i januari 2000</narrative>
  </description>
